PACKAGE NAME:     ntb-djc
COMPRESSED PACKAGE SIZE:     13 K
UNCOMPRESSED PACKAGE SIZE:     80 K
PACKAGE LOCATION: diskt6
PACKAGE DESCRIPTION:
ntb-djc:  ntb-djc 0.1
ntb-djc:
ntb-djc:  These are the binaries for the dvi driver for the HP Deskjet 500, 
ntb-djc:  500c and 550c. They do not use the kpathsea library, and expect the
ntb-djc:  pk files for the Deskjet in the directory /usr/lib/texmf/fonts/pk and
ntb-djc:  the tfm files in /usr/lib/texmf/fonts/tfm. Therefore, if you want to
ntb-djc:  use these drivers you have to copy the pk and tfm files in these 
ntb-djc:  directories or make symbolic links from these directories to the pk 
ntb-djc:  and tfm files.
ntb-djc:
FILE LIST:
./
usr/
usr/bin/
usr/bin/dvi500
usr/bin/dvi500c
usr/bin/dvi550c
